      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-14T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "On November 13, Bahrain's Ministry of Foreign Affairs condemned what it described as Iran's renewed aggression after recent air strikes on Riffa Air Base.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1385842480:66"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-14T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "On 28 February 2026, during the 2026 Iran war, Iran carried out retaliatory missile and drone strikes on Bahrain after the initial strikes.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1385842480:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-14T00:00:33Z",
      "text": "The article lists side 1 as Islamic Resistance in Iraq and Jaysh al-Ghadab, and side 2 as Defensive/precautionary.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:box:1385842480:side-1",
        "wiki:box:1385842480:side-2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-14T00:00:44Z",
      "text": "According to Wikipedia's sources, 2 DOD employees were wounded and 1 oil tanker was damaged.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:box:1385842480:casualties-side-2-"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-14T00:00:56Z",
